			"notes": "# Skin Grabber\nGrabs the skin of the nearest player, to use run `/grabskin`, the player must be within a radius of 5 blocks, or specify the player name directly with `/grabskin [player]`.\n\n## Additions\n* /grabskin now accepts an optional player name argument\n> Most servers automatically add player name auto-completion to all commands, so this is pretty easy to use\n\n## Fixes\n* The radius was set to 4 instead of 5 for some reason, that has been fixed \n* Fixed typo with the word successfully being spelled as `succesfully`"
